"K1881103028" "Gutter Information Officer"
"K2205437527" "Behind me is the elevator to the old section of the city.  It now goes by the apt name, 'the Gutter.' <t=8> Do not interfere with the Arachnoid Contamination Abatement squads in full effect down below. <t=8> Minimize your contact with the hapless citizens that live below.  Any one of them may have Arachnoid contamination."
"K2296056429" "This elevator goes to the East Ward of the Gutter. <t=8> Quarantine is in effect for all citizens that may have come in contact with Arachnoids. <t=4>There are no such things as Arachnoids. <t=4> Should you come in contact with an Arachnoid, please seek out the nearest Arachnos contamination abatement squad. <t=8> They are trained in dealing with such problems."
"K3568463101" "Down this elevator is the East Ward of the Gutter. <t=8>Do not interfere with Arachnos extermination operations underway in the Gutter. <t=8> Watch for Arachnoids. Contamination will not be tolerated."
"K383094713" "Use this elevator, {VillainName}.  It will take you on down to the Gutter, East Ward."
